{"1348516865405050881":{"a":"<p>I really think most people need a monthly payment at least for a few months if we have any chance to deal with the 350k/day infection rate. People are like zombies out there walking around with their masks around their necks and hanging off one ear too tired to even realize it.😭 <a href=\"https://x.com/JoeBiden/status/1348430675238678528\">Tweet by @JoeBiden</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JoeBiden/status/1348430675238678528\">https://x.com/JoeBiden/status/1348430675238678528</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1348516865405050881</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1348516865405050881\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2021-01-11T06:27:29Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1348521081255161856":{"a":"<p>Flag hats. Flag masks. Flag shirts. Flag pants. Flag rags. All of these things are illegal according to flag code. I am sure they would cite 1A but I think if you truly believed in the meaning of the flag and USA you wouldn&#x27;t be disrespecting the flag and then hiding behind it.🤷‍♂️ <a href=\"https://x.com/joshscampbell/status/1348439706548142082\">Tweet by @joshscampbell</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/joshscampbell/status/1348439706548142082\">https://x.com/joshscampbell/status/1348439706548142082</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1348521081255161856</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1348521081255161856\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2021-01-11T06:44:14Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1348529145496657921":{"a":"<p>Working for PIs in the 90s-00s I was always looking for a good digital camera. I borrowed a Kodak NC2000 AP camera (Nikon N90S + DCS420 backplane) to test out. This was a 600mm lens (x2.5?). Lamp post is 1500ft from me. The man is ~4000ft beyond the post. Houses another 2000ft. <a href=\"https://x.com/Rainmaker1973/status/1348265100243824644\">Tweet by @Rainmaker1973</a> t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1348529145496657921-ErbuTk5W4AEI22q.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Rainmaker1973/status/1348265100243824644\">https://x.com/Rainmaker1973/status/1348265100243824644</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1348529145496657921</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1348529145496657921\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2021-01-11T07:16:17Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1348530148052762624":{"a":"<p>I spent an entire day just wandering around my neighborhood taking photos of nature with the NC2000. This was just stunning quality for a digital camera even in 2000. t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1348530148052762624-ErbwrU0XUAABMQb.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1348530148052762624-ErbwrUaW4AEhRsY.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1348530148052762624-ErbwrVTW8AEwTyt.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1348530148052762624-ErbxAzYWMAEP516.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1348530148052762624</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1348530148052762624\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2021-01-11T07:20:16Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1348531113296355329":{"a":"<p><a href=\"http://camera-wiki.org/wiki/Kodak_NC2000\">camera-wiki.org/wiki/Kodak_NC2…</a></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1348531113296355329</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1348531113296355329\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2021-01-11T0